Description: Python client for MultiFlexi API
 MultiFlexi API provides comprehensive access to job execution, application
 management, and user data operations. The API includes GDPR compliance
 endpoints for data export (Article 15 - Right of Access) and uses OAuth2
 Application Flow for security.
 .
 This Python package is automatically generated by the OpenAPI Generator
 project and provides a convenient interface for accessing the MultiFlexi
 API from Python applications.
